{
    "_comment": "The press's single-ink syntax theme (#273). skylighting's default pygments style colours a fenced block tagged yaml/python/sh, and the print interior must carry black ink only (verify_pdf.verify_black_ink), so every token style here is a grey (r == g == b) or a weight/slant: the cues survive on a one-ink press and in a greyscale e-reader. Greys lighter than #555555 are avoided so the smallest token stays legible at 10pt on cream stock.",
